{"id":"integ","类型":"公式本","科目":"高数","讲":"4","名称":"积分公式","简称":"积分","简介":"不定积分表、凑微分、分部和三角代换、定积分的省力结论（对称、区间再现、点火公式、周期）、反常积分基准。","intro":[{"t":"p","text":"不定积分做完可以求导验算：导回去等于被积函数就对了。"}],"sections":[{"id":"1","label":"1","title":"基本积分表","minutes":0,"kind":"","blocks":[{"t":"f","id":"pow","name":"幂函数","tex":"\\int x^\\alpha\\,dx=\\frac{x^{\\alpha+1}}{\\alpha+1}+C\\quad{(\\alpha\\ne-1)}\n\\int\\frac{dx}{x}=\\ln|x|+C","note":"$\\alpha=-1$ 单独记，结果是 $\\ln|x|$，绝对值别丢。","cor":""},{"t":"f","id":"exp","name":"指数函数","tex":"\\int a^x\\,dx=\\frac{a^x}{\\ln a}+C\n\\int e^x\\,dx=e^x+C","note":"","cor":""},{"t":"f","id":"trig","name":"$\\sin$、$\\cos$","tex":"\\int\\sin x\\,dx=-\\cos x+C\n\\int\\cos x\\,dx=\\sin x+C","note":"","cor":""},{"t":"f","id":"tan","name":"$\\tan$、$\\cot$","tex":"\\int\\tan x\\,dx=-\\ln|\\cos x|+C\n\\int\\cot x\\,dx=\\ln|\\sin x|+C","note":"$\\tan x=\\frac{\\sin x}{\\cos x}$，分子是分母导数的相反数。","cor":""},{"t":"f","id":"sec","name":"$\\sec$、$\\csc$","tex":"\\int\\sec x\\,dx=\\ln|\\sec x+\\tan x|+C\n\\int\\csc x\\,dx=\\ln|\\csc x-\\cot x|+C","note":"这两个推导不顺手，直接背；$\\csc x$ 那个中间是「减」。","cor":""},{"t":"f","id":"sec2","name":"平方型","tex":"\\int\\sec^2x\\,dx=\\tan x+C\n\\int\\csc^2x\\,dx=-\\cot x+C\n\\int\\sec x\\tan x\\,dx=\\sec x+C","note":"就是求导表倒过来。","cor":""},{"t":"f","id":"atan","name":"$\\frac1{a^2+x^2}$","tex":"\\int\\frac{dx}{a^2+x^2}=\\frac1a\\arctan\\frac xa+C","note":"前面有个 $\\frac1a$。分母是二次式就先配方：$\\int\\frac{dx}{x^2+2x+5}=\\frac12\\arctan\\frac{x+1}2+C$。","cor":""},{"t":"f","id":"asin","name":"$\\frac1{\\sqrt{a^2-x^2}}$","tex":"\\int\\frac{dx}{\\sqrt{a^2-x^2}}=\\arcsin\\frac xa+C","note":"这一条前面**没有** $\\frac1a$，和上一条对比着记。","cor":""},{"t":"f","id":"log","name":"$\\frac1{x^2-a^2}$","tex":"\\int\\frac{dx}{x^2-a^2}=\\frac{1}{2a}\\ln\\left|\\frac{x-a}{x+a}\\right|+C","note":"拆成 $\\frac1{2a}\\left(\\frac1{x-a}-\\frac1{x+a}\\right)$ 再积分，就能推出来。","cor":""},{"t":"f","id":"lnsqrt","name":"$\\frac1{\\sqrt{x^2\\pm a^2}}$","tex":"\\int\\frac{dx}{\\sqrt{x^2\\pm a^2}}=\\ln\\left|x+\\sqrt{x^2\\pm a^2}\\right|+C","note":"求导验证：$\\left[\\ln\\left(x+\\sqrt{x^2+a^2}\\right)\\right]'=\\frac1{\\sqrt{x^2+a^2}}$。","cor":""},{"t":"f","id":"circ","name":"$\\sqrt{a^2-x^2}$","tex":"\\int\\sqrt{a^2-x^2}\\,dx=\\frac x2\\sqrt{a^2-x^2}+\\frac{a^2}2\\arcsin\\frac xa+C","note":"定积分直接看面积：$\\int_0^a\\sqrt{a^2-x^2}\\,dx=\\frac{\\pi a^2}4$（四分之一个圆）。","cor":""}]},{"id":"2","label":"2","title":"方法","minutes":0,"kind":"","blocks":[{"t":"f","id":"couwei","name":"凑微分","tex":"\\int f(ax+b)\\,dx=\\frac1a\\int f(u)\\,du\\quad{(u=ax+b)}\n\\int f(x^n)\\,x^{n-1}dx=\\frac1n\\int f(u)\\,du\\quad{(u=x^n)}","note":"常见的「一对」：$\\frac{dx}{x}=d\\ln x$，$e^xdx=de^x$，$\\cos x\\,dx=d\\sin x$，$\\sec^2x\\,dx=d\\tan x$，$\\frac{dx}{1+x^2}=d\\arctan x$，$\\frac{dx}{\\sqrt x}=2\\,d\\sqrt x$。","cor":""},{"t":"f","id":"parts","name":"分部积分","tex":"\\int u\\,dv=uv-\\int v\\,du","note":"选 $u$ 的顺序「反对幂指三」：反三角、对数优先当 $u$，指数、三角留给 $dv$。","cor":"定积分：$\\int_a^bu\\,dv=uv\\Big|_a^b-\\int_a^bv\\,du$。"},{"t":"f","id":"sub","name":"三角代换","tex":"\\sqrt{a^2-x^2}:\\ x=a\\sin t\n\\sqrt{a^2+x^2}:\\ x=a\\tan t\n\\sqrt{x^2-a^2}:\\ x=a\\sec t","note":"目的是用 $1-\\sin^2t=\\cos^2t$、$1+\\tan^2t=\\sec^2t$、$\\sec^2t-1=\\tan^2t$ 把根号去掉。","cor":""},{"t":"f","id":"rational","name":"有理函数拆分","tex":"\\frac{1}{(x-a)(x-b)}=\\frac{1}{a-b}\\left(\\frac{1}{x-a}-\\frac{1}{x-b}\\right)","note":"分母能分解就拆成简单分式；分子次数不低于分母时，先做多项式除法。","cor":""}]},{"id":"3","label":"3","title":"定积分的省力结论","minutes":0,"kind":"","blocks":[{"t":"f","id":"sym","name":"对称区间","tex":"\\int_{-a}^{a}f(x)\\,dx=\\int_0^a\\big[f(x)+f(-x)\\big]\\,dx","note":"$f$ 奇时为 0，$f$ 偶时为 $2\\int_0^af$。不奇不偶也能用这一条。","cor":""},{"t":"f","id":"reflect","name":"区间再现","tex":"\\int_a^bf(x)\\,dx=\\int_a^bf(a+b-x)\\,dx","note":"令 $x=a+b-t$。新式和原式相加，常能消掉难算的部分。","cor":"$\\int_0^{\\frac\\pi2}f(\\sin x)\\,dx=\\int_0^{\\frac\\pi2}f(\\cos x)\\,dx$；$\\int_0^\\pi xf(\\sin x)\\,dx=\\dfrac\\pi2\\int_0^\\pi f(\\sin x)\\,dx$。"},{"t":"f","id":"wallis","name":"点火公式","tex":"\\int_0^{\\frac\\pi2}\\sin^nx\\,dx=\\int_0^{\\frac\\pi2}\\cos^nx\\,dx\n=\\frac{n-1}{n}\\cdot\\frac{n-3}{n-2}\\cdots\\times\\begin{cases}\\dfrac12\\cdot\\dfrac\\pi2,&n\\text{ 偶}\\\\[4pt]\\dfrac23,&n\\text{ 奇}\\end{cases}","note":"从 $\\frac{n-1}{n}$ 开始，分子分母每次减 2 往下乘；偶数最后乘 $\\frac\\pi2$，奇数乘到 $\\frac23$ 为止（$n=1$ 时积分是 1）。","cor":"$\\int_0^{\\frac\\pi2}\\sin^2x\\,dx=\\frac\\pi4$，$\\int_0^{\\frac\\pi2}\\sin^3x\\,dx=\\frac23$，$\\int_0^{\\frac\\pi2}\\sin^4x\\,dx=\\frac{3\\pi}{16}$。"},{"t":"f","id":"period","name":"周期函数","tex":"\\int_a^{a+T}f(x)\\,dx=\\int_0^Tf(x)\\,dx","note":"长为一个周期的区间，从哪里开始积分都一样。","cor":"$\\int_0^{n\\pi}|\\sin x|\\,dx=2n$。"},{"t":"f","id":"mvt","name":"积分中值定理","tex":"\\int_a^bf(x)\\,dx=f(\\xi)(b-a),\\quad{\\xi\\in[a,b]}","note":"$f$ 连续才行。平均值 $\\frac1{b-a}\\int_a^bf$ 一定被 $f$ 在某一点取到。","cor":""},{"t":"f","id":"newton","name":"牛顿–莱布尼茨公式","tex":"\\int_a^bf(x)\\,dx=F(b)-F(a)\\quad{(F'=f)}","note":"前提是 $f$ 在 $[a,b]$ 上连续；区间里有瑕点就不能直接用。","cor":""},{"t":"f","id":"pp","name":"反常积分基准","tex":"\\int_1^{+\\infty}\\frac{dx}{x^p}\\ \\text{收敛}\\Leftrightarrow p>1\n\\int_0^1\\frac{dx}{x^p}\\ \\text{收敛}\\Leftrightarrow p<1","note":"$p=1$ 两边都发散。等价比较时，在每个坏点附近化成 $\\frac{C}{x^p}$ 再查这一条。","cor":"$\\int_2^{+\\infty}\\dfrac{dx}{x\\ln^qx}$ 收敛 $\\Leftrightarrow q>1$。"}]}],"used":{"newton":[{"book":"gs05","sec":"3","title":"高数第5讲 · 节3 凹凸、拐点与导函数图像"},{"book":"gs08","sec":"1","title":"高数第8讲 · 节1 定积分定义：和式极限化成积分"},{"book":"gs08","sec":"6","title":"高数第8讲 · 节6 反常积分：先找坏点，能算就直接算"},{"book":"gs09","sec":"1","title":"高数第9讲 · 节1 基本积分表与凑微分"}],"atan":[{"book":"gs08","sec":"1","title":"高数第8讲 · 节1 定积分定义：和式极限化成积分"},{"book":"gs09","sec":"1","title":"高数第9讲 · 节1 基本积分表与凑微分"},{"book":"gs09","sec":"6","title":"高数第9讲 · 节6 反常积分的计算"}],"couwei":[{"book":"gs08","sec":"1","title":"高数第8讲 · 节1 定积分定义：和式极限化成积分"},{"book":"gs08","sec":"6","title":"高数第8讲 · 节6 反常积分：先找坏点，能算就直接算"},{"book":"gs09","sec":"1","title":"高数第9讲 · 节1 基本积分表与凑微分"}],"parts":[{"book":"gs08","sec":"1","title":"高数第8讲 · 节1 定积分定义：和式极限化成积分"},{"book":"gs08","sec":"3","title":"高数第8讲 · 节3 平均值与积分中值定理"},{"book":"gs